{
  "id": "E263",
  "title": "Bargaining in China",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-10-17",
  "synopsis": "Learn some bargaining skills from Annie.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/867/40d38a0c8da82a0bd7dc6db73b9be4b230cd6659.mp3?1538293406",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "砍价\n\n安妮：老板，这个包多少钱？\n老板：480块。你眼光真好，这可是真皮的。\n安妮：这也太贵了，能便宜点儿吗？\n老板：这款卖得很好，就剩这一个了。460，怎么样？\n安妮：这也没便宜多少啊。\n老板：那你开个价吧。\n安妮：100块。\n老板：你开玩笑吧！哪有你这么砍价的！\n安妮：不行吗？那算了吧，我走了。\n老板：你回来回来！150，你拿走吧！\n安妮：行，谢谢老板！",
    "traditional": "砍價\n\n安妮：老闆，這個包多少錢？\n老闆：480塊。你眼光真好，這可是真皮的。\n安妮：這也太貴了，能便宜點兒嗎？\n老闆：這款賣得很好，就剩這一個了。460，怎麼樣？\n安妮：這也沒便宜多少啊。\n老闆：那你開個價吧。\n安妮：100塊。\n老闆：你開玩笑吧！哪有你這麼砍價的！\n安妮：不行嗎？那算了吧，我走了。\n老闆：你回來回來！150，你拿走吧！\n安妮：行，謝謝老闆！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Bargaining in China"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "安妮：老板，这个包多少钱？",
      "traditional": "安妮：老闆，這個包多少錢？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī lǎo bǎn zhè ge bāo duō shao qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Boss, how much is this bag?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "老板：480块。你眼光真好，这可是真皮的。",
      "traditional": "老闆：480塊。你眼光真好，這可是真皮的。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo bǎn 4 kuài nǐ yǎn guāng zhēn hǎo zhè kě shì zhēn pí de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop owner: 480 yuan. You have very good taste. This is real leather."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "安妮：这也太贵了，能便宜点儿吗？",
      "traditional": "安妮：這也太貴了，能便宜點兒嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī zhè yě tài guì le néng pián yi diǎn'r ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: It’s too expensive. Can you make it a bit cheaper?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "老板：这款卖得很好，就剩这一个了。460，怎么样？",
      "traditional": "老闆：這款賣得很好，就剩這一個了。460，怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "lǎo bǎn zhè kuǎn mài de hěn hǎo jiù shèng zhè yí ge le 4 zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop owner: This bag sells really well, and this is the only one left. How about 460 yuan?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "安妮：这也没便宜多少啊。",
      "traditional": "安妮：這也沒便宜多少啊。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī zhè yě méi pián yi duō shao a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: That is not much cheaper than before."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "老板：那你开个价吧。",
      "traditional": "老闆：那你開個價吧。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo bǎn nà nǐ kāi ge jià ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop owner: Then give me your price."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "安妮：100块。",
      "traditional": "安妮：100塊。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī 2 kuài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: 100 yuan."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "老板：你开玩笑吧！哪有你这么砍价的！",
      "traditional": "老闆：你開玩笑吧！哪有你這麼砍價的！",
      "pinyin": "lǎo bǎn nǐ kāi wán xiào ba nǎ yǒu nǐ zhè me kǎn jià de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop owner: Are you kidding? How can you bargain like this?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "安妮：不行吗？那算了吧，我走了。",
      "traditional": "安妮：不行嗎？那算了吧，我走了。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī bù xíng ma nà suàn le ba wǒ zǒu le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Doesn’t work? Ok, I’ll leave."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "老板：你回来回来！150，你拿走吧！",
      "traditional": "老闆：你回來回來！150，你拿走吧！",
      "pinyin": "lǎo bǎn nǐ huí lái huí lái 4 nǐ ná zǒu ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop owner: Come back, come back! 150 yuan, you can take it."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "安妮：行，谢谢老板！",
      "traditional": "安妮：行，謝謝老闆！",
      "pinyin": "ān nī xíng xiè xie lǎo bǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Ok. Thanks, boss!"
    }
  ],
