    "sentence_translations": [
      "Bargaining in China",
      "",
      "Annie: Boss, how much is this bag?",
      "",
      "Shop owner: 480 yuan. You have very good taste. This is real leather.",
      "",
      "Annie: It’s too expensive. Can you make it a bit cheaper?",
      "",
      "Shop owner: This bag sells really well, and this is the only one left. How about 460 yuan?",
      "",
      "Annie: That is not much cheaper than before.",
      "",
      "Shop owner: Then give me your price.",
      "",
      "Annie: 100 yuan.",
      "",
      "Shop owner: Are you kidding? How can you bargain like this?",
      "",
